{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794815825252,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea9ffed5hOlqAimuHTWO","part":{"partID":"prt_1e35bc0d7002LJAd7wKPBDo370","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea9ffed5hOlqAimuHTWO","messageID":"msg_1e35bb1d2001RuJNeVfgtdkXxf","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-8cc57ee988dfde09","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Deep Review Strategy - merge-docs-6\n\n## 1. OVERVIEW\n\n### Purpose\n\nPersistent review state for the merge-docs area of code review pass six. Tracks dimension coverage, findings, and the next focus across the lineage's iterations.\n\n### Usage\n\n- Read at the start of every iteration before any review action.\n- Updated in place after the iteration's findings are written.\n- Machine-owned blocks stay between their markers.\n\n## 2. TOPIC\n\nReview pass six, merge-docs area: this branch's net change to the twelve files a merge with main resolved, checking that nothing main added was lost and that each documentation claim is true of the code.\n\n---\n\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 4. NON-GOALS\n\n- Re-reporting the pass-six recorded limits without a new breaking input: the `node -e` arrow inside escaped quotes reading as a redirect, `isolation-check.sh` being macOS only, `started` versus `offered` not rebuilding from `readOnly`, older goal rows keeping old-rule figures, and the declined turn duration, OpenCode delivery receipt and longer cap.\n- Reviewing files outside the twelve merge-docs scope paths, except as read-only context evidence for a claim.\n- Changing code or docs under review.\n\n---\n\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- Three iterations reached (`maxIterations: 3`).\n- Weighted new-finding ratio at or below the 0.10 convergence threshold after the minimum two iterations.\n- A hard gate failure that prevents further review.\n\n---\n\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\n\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\n\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Review angles investigated and definitively eliminated]\n\n---\n\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Dimension: traceability\n- Focus area: the twelve merge-docs scope files, starting with the merge-loss check and the changelog/README claims\n- Reason: first pass; the area is defined as a merge-resolution review\n- Rotation status: not started\n- Required evidence: per-file net diff plus code evidence for each documentation claim\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\n\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\n\n- Target pointers: the twelve paths in `review/review-scope-6.txt` with area `merge-docs`.\n- Behavior claims: the net diff `695f4191d36620b42b5f76a28c25e460fccdd0f7..85550ee946e` for each path; the review brief's instruction that nothing main added was lost and each claim is true of the code.\n- Reuse and conventions: pass-five lineage reports under `review/lineages/*-5` for prior documented limits and findings.\n- Review risks and gaps: merges rewrote whole lines, so a line-presence check over-reports; each candidate must be read in context. Some claims live in code outside the twelve paths and are cited only as context.\n\n---\n\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[Alignment checks completed across core and overlay protocols]\n\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n[Per-file coverage state table -- populated during initialization from scope discovery]\n\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\n| .github/workflows/spec-kit-check.yml | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/agents/markdown.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/sk-doc/manifest.json | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.1.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/changelog/v2.13.4.0.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/ENV-REFERENCE.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| .vibe/agents/markdown.toml | - | - | - | pending |\n| CONTRIBUTING.md | - | - | - | pending |\n| README.md | - | - | - | pending |\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Max iterations: 3\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-merge-docs-6-1794815529929-dybl7p, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\n- Per-iteration budget: 60 tool calls, 10 minutes\n- Severity threshold: P2\n- Review target type: spec-folder\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\n- Started: 2026-11-16T07:56:07.000Z\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\": \"# Deep Review Strategy - merge-docs-6\\n\\n## 1. OVERVIEW\\n\\n### Purpose\\n\\nPersistent review state for the merge-docs area of code review pass six. Tracks dimension coverage, findings, and the next focus across the lineage's iterations.\\n\\n### Usage\\n\\n- Read at the start of every iteration before any review action.\\n- Updated in place after the iteration's findings are written.\\n- Machine-owned blocks stay between their markers.\\n\\n## 2. TOPIC\\n\\nReview pass six, merge-docs area: this branch's net change to the twelve files a merge with main resolved, checking that nothing main added was lost and that each documentation claim is true of the code.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- [ ] D1 Correctness, Logic errors, off-by-one, wrong return types, broken invariants\\n- [ ] D2 Security, Injection, auth bypass, secrets exposure, unsafe deserialization\\n- [ ] D3 Traceability, Spec/code alignment, checklist evidence, cross-reference integrity\\n- [ ] D4 Maintainability, Patterns, clarity, documentation quality, safe follow-on change cost\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 4. NON-GOALS\\n\\n- Re-reporting the pass-six recorded limits without a new breaking input: the `node -e` arrow inside escaped quotes reading as a redirect, `isolation-check.sh` being macOS only, `started` versus `offered` not rebuilding from `readOnly`, older goal rows keeping old-rule figures, and the declined turn duration, OpenCode delivery receipt and longer cap.\\n- Reviewing files outside the twelve merge-docs scope paths, except as read-only context evidence for a claim.\\n- Changing code or docs under review.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 5. STOP CONDITIONS\\n\\n- Three iterations reached (`maxIterations: 3`).\\n- Weighted new-finding ratio at or below the 0.10 convergence threshold after the minimum two iterations.\\n- A hard gate failure that prevents further review.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 6. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 7. RUNNING FINDINGS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- **P0 (Critical):** 0 active\\n- **P1 (Major):** 0 active\\n- **P2 (Minor):** 0 active\\n- **Delta this iteration:** +0 P0, +0 P1, +0 P2\\n\\n[Findings are tracked in `deep-review-findings-registry.json`. This section provides a running count summary updated after each iteration.]\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Completed pivots: 0\\n- Failed pivots: 0\\n- Audited overrides: 0\\n- Swept: none yet\\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\\n[Review angles investigated and definitively eliminated]\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 12. NEXT FOCUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Dimension: traceability\\n- Focus area: the twelve merge-docs scope files, starting with the merge-loss check and the changelog/README claims\\n- Reason: first pass; the area is defined as a merge-resolution review\\n- Rotation status: not started\\n- Required evidence: per-file net diff plus code evidence for each documentation claim\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 13. KNOWN CONTEXT\\n\\n### Bounded Context Snapshot\\n\\n- Target pointers: the twelve paths in `review/review-scope-6.txt` with area `merge-docs`.\\n- Behavior claims: the net diff `695f4191d36620b42b5f76a28c25e460fccdd0f7..85550ee946e` for each path; the review brief's instruction that nothing main added was lost and each claim is true of the code.\\n- Reuse and conventions: pass-five lineage reports under `review/lineages/*-5` for prior documented limits and findings.\\n- Review risks and gaps: merges rewrote whole lines, so a line-presence check over-reports; each candidate must be read in context. Some claims live in code outside the twelve paths and are cited only as context.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 14. CROSS-REFERENCE STATUS\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[Alignment checks completed across core and overlay protocols]\\n\\n| Protocol | Level | Status | Iteration | Notes |\\n|----------|-------|--------|-----------|-------|\\n| `spec_code` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `checklist_evidence` | core | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `skill_agent` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `agent_cross_runtime` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `feature_catalog_code` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n| `playbook_capability` | overlay | [pending] | [N] | [details] |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 15. FILES UNDER REVIEW\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n[Per-file coverage state table -- populated during initialization from scope discovery]\\n\\n| File | Dimensions Reviewed | Last Iteration | Findings | Status |\\n|------|-------------------|----------------|----------|--------|\\n| .github/workflows/spec-kit-check.yml | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/agents/markdown.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/bin/lib/compiled-routing/013-live-activation/activation/sk-doc/manifest.json | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.1.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/README.markdown | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/hooks/shared/session-readers/README.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/SKILL.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/changelog/v2.13.4.0.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/ENV-REFERENCE.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| .vibe/agents/markdown.toml | - | - | - | pending |\\n| CONTRIBUTING.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n| README.md | - | - | - | pending |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 16. REVIEW BOUNDARIES\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\\n- Max iterations: 3\\n- Convergence threshold: 0.1\\n- Rolling STOP threshold: 0.08\\n- No-progress threshold: 0.05\\n- Coverage stabilization passes required: 1\\n- Session lineage: sessionId=fanout-merge-docs-6-1794815529929-dybl7p, parentSessionId=null, generation=1, lineageMode=new\\n- Findings registry: `deep-review-findings-registry.json`\\n- Release-readiness states: in-progress | converged | release-blocking\\n- Per-iteration budget: 60 tool calls, 10 minutes\\n- Severity threshold: P2\\n- Review target type: spec-folder\\n- Cross-reference checks: core=[spec_code, checklist_evidence], overlay=[skill_agent, agent_cross_runtime, feature_catalog_code, playbook_capability]\\n- Started: 2026-11-16T07:56:07.000Z\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\\n\", \"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1794815803607,"end":1794815825252}}}}
