ing field in stderr JSON is FAIL, with repair npm --prefix .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime run build. Exit 75 without that field is SKIP because the daemon is not running. Any other exit is FAIL, with repair /doctor:skill-advisor rebuild. When data.hookHealth is present, show hook p95 <rollingP95Ms> ms over <invocations> prompts, fail-open <rollingFailOpenRate as a percent>, degraded <rollingDegradedRate as a percent> and last record <lastRecordAt> under the leg. It never changes the leg's status. When data.hookHealth is absent, show hook health not recorded under the leg, because no prompt hook has written a record for this checkout yet: OpenCode has no prompt hook that writes one and an unapproved Codex hook never runs. It never changes the leg's status.\"\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && grep -n \\\"diagnostic\\\\|health\\\\|persist\\\" .opencode/plugins/system-skill-advisor.js | head -20; echo \\\"--- advisor_status hookHealth fields\\\"; sed -n '495,520p' .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-status.ts; echo \\\"--- setup advisor leg\\\"; grep -rn \\\"hookHealth\\\" .skilled/commands/doctor --include=*.md --include=*.yaml --include=*.cjs | head -10\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816063503,"end":1794816064643}}}}
