         |      2 +-\n .skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md             |     74 +-\n .skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs           |     14 +-\n .../cli-external-orchestration/manifest.json       |      2 +-\n .../activation/sk-doc/manifest.json                |      2 +-\n .skilled/bin/skilled-loop                          |     16 +-\n .skilled/changelog/skilled/v1+/v1.0.0.0.md         |      8 +-\n .skilled/changelog/skilled/v1+/v1.1.0.0.md         |     18 +-\n .skilled/changelog/skilled/v1+/v1.2.0.0.md         |     24 +-\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"c88dabe8292 Merge origin/main into worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research\nc54f98bdcfb fix(system-deep-loop): state the traceability evidence rule in every review iteration\n103bd4679bc docs(changelog): add the review count, debt and last-iteration fixes to v4.0.2.1\n4f47d15fcc7 docs(changelog): count Mistral Vibe among the dotenv guard runtimes\n33fc66ca82a docs(changelog): add the computed review checks to v4.0.2.1\n--- when 2.13.4\nc88dabe8292 Merge origin/main into worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research\n--- show commit\nc88dabe8292 Merge origin/main into worktrees/352-command-surfacing-research\n\n .cursorignore                                      |      3 -\n .env.example                                       |      2 +-\n .github/workflows/spec-kit-check.yml               |     16 +\n .opencode/plugins/session-handover.js              |     32 +-\n .opencode/plugins/tests/session-handover.test.cjs  |     55 +\n .pi/agents/deep-research.md                        |      2 +-\n .skilled/CROSS-CLI.md                              |     10 +-\n .skilled/agents/README.txt                         |      5 +-\n .skilled/agents/deep-research.md                   |      1 +\n .skilled/agents/markdown.md                        |      2 +-\n .skilled/bin/agent-mirror-crosswalk.md             |     74 +-\n .skilled/bin/check-agent-mirror-sync.cjs           |     14 +-\n .../cli-external-orchestration/manifest.json       |      2 +-\n .../activation/sk-doc/manifest.json                |      2 +-\n .skilled/bin/skilled-loop                          |     16 +-\n .skilled/changelog/skilled/v1+/v1.0.0.0.md         |      8 +-\n .skilled/changelog/skilled/v1+/v1.1.0.0.md         |     18 +-\n .skilled/changelog/skilled/v1+/v1.2.0.0.md         |     24 +-\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\": \"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && git log --oneline -5 -- .skilled/changelog/skilled/v4.0.2.1.md; echo \\\"--- when 2.13.4\\\"; git log --format='%h %s' -5 -- .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/changelog/v2.13.4.0.md; echo \\\"--- show commit\\\"; git show --stat --oneline $(git log --format=%H -1 -- .skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/changelog/v2.13.4.0.md) | head -20\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816161797,"end":1794816166112}}}}
