ary |\n |-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\n+| D3 Traceability | PASS (2 P2) | 1 | No line main held was lost; two doc-vs-code gaps found (release-note version range, README health-record exception) |\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ---\n \n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":2}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md\", \"oldString\": \"[None yet -- populated as iterations complete dimension reviews]\\n\\n| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\", \"newString\": \"| Dimension | Verdict | Iteration | Summary |\\n|-----------|---------|-----------|---------|\\n| D3 Traceability | PASS (2 P2) | 1 | No line main held was lost; two doc-vs-code gaps found (release-note version range, README health-record exception) |\\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\"}"},"time":{"start":1794816819094,"end":1794816819638}}}}
