{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794816833267,"sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea9ffed5hOlqAimuHTWO","part":{"partID":"prt_1e36b5da6001YcZkcHjQMCLWqf","sessionID":"ses_e1ca84ea9ffed5hOlqAimuHTWO","messageID":"msg_1e36b4c16001tLpClUQ1hKuMVK","type":"tool","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9cd6d7549c48dd9e","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"newString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Reading the merge base as main's tip: since `695f4191d` is both the merge base and the parent main merge, the single net diff exposed every line main held, so a line-presence sweep plus context reads proved the merge-loss question directly (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n- A raw line-presence detector over-reports paragraph rewrites as lost lines; the first pass had to read every candidate in context before it produced a usable signal (iteration 1).\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: traceability\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: correctness, security, maintainability\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n- A lost main sentence in README, CONTRIBUTING, ENV-REFERENCE or the session-readers README: the net diff adds or rewrites only, and the final merge's parent-to-result diff is empty for README (iteration 1).\n- A stale `.vibe` mirror of the renamed markdown agent: the instructions payload equals the canonical body exactly (iteration 1).\n- A false TOML caveat in the doctor README: the command regex rejects a trailing comment and a single-quoted command (iteration 1).\n- A false \"four children\" claim in the doctor README: four child runs exist; the stale wording is a code comment outside the scope (iteration 1).","oldString":"## 8. WHAT WORKED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 9. WHAT FAILED\n[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n\n---\n\n## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n[Populated when an approach has been tried from multiple angles without yielding new findings]\n\n---\n\n## 10A. SATURATED / SWEPT DIMENSIONS AND EXPANSION FRONTIER\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n- Completed pivots: 0\n- Failed pivots: 0\n- Audited overrides: 0\n- Swept: none yet\n- Pivot lineage: none yet\n- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n<!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n\n---\n\n## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n[Review angles investigated and definitively eliminated]","path":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md"},"output":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md","patch":"Index: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n===================================================================\n--- specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n+++ specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md\n@@ -65,14 +65,14 @@\n \n ---\n \n ## 8. WHAT WORKED\n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- Reading the merge base as main's tip: since `695f4191d` is both the merge base and the parent main merge, the single net diff exposed every line main held, so a line-presence sweep plus context reads proved the merge-loss question directly (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 9. WHAT FAILED\n-[First iteration -- populated after iteration 1 completes]\n+- A raw line-presence detector over-reports paragraph rewrites as lost lines; the first pass had to read every candidate in context before it produced a usable signal (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 10. EXHAUSTED APPROACHES (do not retry)\n@@ -84,17 +84,20 @@\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: START -->\n - Completed pivots: 0\n - Failed pivots: 0\n - Audited overrides: 0\n-- Swept: none yet\n+- Swept: traceability\n - Pivot lineage: none yet\n-- Remaining frontier: none recorded\n+- Remaining frontier: correctness, security, maintainability\n <!-- MACHINE-OWNED: END -->\n \n ---\n \n ## 11. RULED OUT DIRECTIONS\n-[Review angles investigated and definitively eliminated]\n+- A lost main sentence in README, CONTRIBUTING, ENV-REFERENCE or the session-readers README: the net diff adds or rewrites only, and the final merge's parent-to-result diff is empty for README (iteration 1).\n+- A stale `.vibe` mirror of the renamed markdown agent: the instructions payload equals the canonical body exactly (iteration 1).\n+- A false TOML caveat in the doctor README: the command regex rejects a trailing comment and a single-quoted command (iteration 1).\n+- A false \"four children\" claim in the doctor README: four child runs exist; the stale wording is a code comment outside the scope (iteration 1).\n \n ---\n \n ## 12. NEXT FOCUS\n","status":"modified","additions":8,"deletions":5}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/merge-docs-6/deep-review-strategy.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"newString\": \"## 8. WHAT WORKED\\n- Reading the merge base as main's tip: since `695f4191d` is both the merge base and the parent main merge, the single net diff exposed every line main held, so a line-presence sweep plus context reads pr